WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.800
- I just discovered Face Dance,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.499
which is like an app game.

00:00:04.499 --> 00:00:06.760
It's like DDR for you face.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.657
And I think it's the funniest
shit I have ever seen.

00:00:09.657 --> 00:00:11.199
So I'm about to go around the office

00:00:11.199 --> 00:00:14.905
and make all of my
coworkers look ridiculous.

00:00:14.905 --> 00:00:17.822
(electronic music)

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:32.977
- (laughing) I just feel
like I'm spazzing out.

00:00:34.093 --> 00:00:35.762
- Am I copying this one?

00:00:35.762 --> 00:00:39.929
- [Man] You're copying the
emojis that are floating by.

00:00:44.764 --> 00:00:45.847
- Crazy time.

00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:55.493
- How, this is so--

00:00:55.493 --> 00:00:59.030
(laughing) I give up on this.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:00.105
(laughing)

00:01:00.105 --> 00:01:04.272
- This is getting tiring. (laughing)

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.549
(laughing)

00:01:15.759 --> 00:01:17.708
- Oh god, is it ever over?

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:18.979
- (laughing) This hurts my face!

00:01:18.979 --> 00:01:21.128
(laughing)

00:01:21.128 --> 00:01:23.711
- That's fuckin' hard.
- It is.

00:01:26.669 --> 00:01:29.789
- I'm overstimulated, I can't do it.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:33.122
That is what it feels like to
watch seven toddlers at once,

00:01:33.122 --> 00:01:35.130
and there's just too much going on.

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:36.390
- I think it's a good bathroom game,

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:38.406
if I'm on the toilet.

00:01:38.406 --> 00:01:40.388
In public, it's a little more awkward.

00:01:40.388 --> 00:01:41.968
- It was an interesting experience,

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.907
but it's strangely fun.

00:01:43.907 --> 00:01:46.299
I would never play this in public though.

00:01:46.299 --> 00:01:48.017
- I got 900 points.

00:01:48.017 --> 00:01:50.339
The fact that I got the lowest points,

00:01:50.339 --> 00:01:52.940
I mean I believe it, it's
fine, it's fine. (laughing)

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.089
- 1870.

00:01:54.089 --> 00:01:55.578
- [Woman] That's terrible.

00:01:55.578 --> 00:01:56.907
(laughing)

00:01:56.907 --> 00:01:58.457
- [Woman] Quinta, you
got the highest score

00:01:58.457 --> 00:01:59.589
out of everyone.

00:01:59.589 --> 00:02:01.776
- Yeah, winnin' is a habit. (laughing)

00:02:01.776 --> 00:02:04.693
(electronic music)

